"P4160567279" "Yeah?"
// HelloString :
"P542885946" "What?"
// HelloString :
"P3673355685" "Hurmph."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2028478334" "Beat it before I beat you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P581567658" "So you've decided you're tired of all these 'Destined Ones', eh? Well, maybe we can work together and do something about it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1838385707" "You and me, we've got nothing more to do with one another."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2317327137" "I'd love to work with you, but you look like you are already indebted to too many other people at this time."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3988503365" "I don't have anything for you right now, but come back when you are Threat Level {Level} and we can talk some more."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1830387476" "Well, look at that, the insignificant one actually has some potential."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P778484191" "Players should never see this"
// LocationString :
"P2613846116" "Mercy Island"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P915225571" "You should go and see Kalinda now that you are on the list and start doing what she needs. I should have more for you to do when you are Threat Level 5.<br><br>On the off chance you don't want to deal with Arachnos much, I'd go speak with Burke."
