"P3568938682" "The future holds more for you and I, but it must wait until you are Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1652244592" "I sense our destinies becoming more entwined."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P753883263" "Fate is fickle, but I can hold her back."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2913218038" "You must seek your fate elsewhere, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
"P3766049399" "Cap au Diable"
// IntroString :
"P58810594" "Forunata Hamilton is the one you need to seek. She and Alan have a deal, she won't give him up to Arachnos, and he won't clue them in on her dirty little secret. I'll make the intros now, but she won't have anything for you to do specifically until you are Threat Level 15."
